e lighting sequence !\n- TIME BOMB : Play with a bomb, but when will it explode ?\n- TIME BOMB 2 : Play with a bomb, but when will it explode ? Your score grows up as long as you have the bomb.\n- LAST ONE : Don't be the last to keep the ball !\n- FIND ME : Try to find ECHO before time's up !\n- HIDDEN BOMB : 20 balls, one of them is a bomb !\n- MEMORY : Try to remember where are the correct balls !\n- BONTO : 3 Boxes, one ball, try to find it !\n- SPEED TOUCH : Be faster than ECHO to touch the speed button !\n\nMany more games are coming on the next updates !\n\nFrom creators of Beasts of Legend VR!", "short_description": "10 games in 1! Try to survive to ECHO's challenge! Have fun with your new friend!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://echovr.virtual-studios.fr/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://echovr.virtual-studios.fr/", "publisher_name": "Virtual Studios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://echovr.virtual-studios.fr/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ARCADE", "CASUAL", "PUZZLE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["GAMEPAD", "GEAR_VR_CONTROLLER", "TOUCHPAD"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "330303455699553"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12139007_1487591181367892_7238696215200661504_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OpM3BCRXA30Q7kNvwEAx8aM&_nc_oc=AdruavxSoJAfyZp2eqAZP7dx5OBSXPOoyaG0R8ipRIbOLcnMa0ns1HGnTF8TrrgvEqA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_